@{
    ViewBag.Title = "About PawPoint";
}

<div style="max-width: 800px; line-height: 1.6;">
    <p><b>PawPoint</b> is an enterprise-grade ASP.NET Core MVC web application developed for the AMIT2014 course.</p>

    <h3>Key System Architecture Features</h3>
    <ul>
        <li><b>Table-per-Hierarchy (TPH) Security</b>: Custom cookie authentication supporting Admin, Staff, and Customer roles with claim-based authorization and session lockout protection.</li>
        <li><b>Many-to-Many Relationships</b>: Multi-service appointment bookings (<code>AppointmentService</code>) and staff service qualification tracking (<code>StaffService</code>).</li>
        <li><b>Slot Availability Matrix Grid</b>: Multi-branch time-slot availability checking.</li>
        <li><b>E-Commerce &amp; Session Cart</b>: Full product catalog, session cart management, loyalty points redemption, and order receipts.</li>
        <li><b>Automated Notifications</b>: SMTP email delivery for OTP verification, password reset, confirmation notices, and SMS ledger updates.</li>
        <li><b>Real-Time SignalR Support Chat</b>: Live bi-directional customer support room.</li>
        <li><b>Interactive Visual Analytics</b>: Dynamic on-screen revenue, booking, and loyalty reports.</li>
    </ul>
</div>
